# Upload ONLY what the Docker builds need (gcloud builds submit / run deploy).
# Whitelist style: ignore everything, then re-include the build inputs.
/*
!Dockerfile
!Dockerfile.predictor
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!dashboard/
!ingestion/
!ml/
# ~15 GB of local training runs — never uploaded. The predictor build fetches
# its one pinned run from GCS into ml_artifacts/ inside the build workspace.
ml/artifacts/
**/__pycache__/
# Never upload local secrets or environments (already excluded by /*; explicit for safety).
.env
.venv/
